class=\"p-0 col-md-6 col-12\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Foto_Lifestyle_04.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\"></div> <div class=\"p-0 bg-light position-relative d-flex banner-sidetext-box col-md-6 col-12\"><div class=\"d-flex p-0 col-12 text-center align-items-center\"><div class=\"product-banner-box col-12 m-auto\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-Premium.png\" class=\"m-auto\"> <p class=\"product-banner-subtitle mb-0\">Premium quality</p> <p></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!----></div> <!----> <div class=\"row col-12 col-xl-9 p-0 m-auto\"><div class=\"home-lg-section p-0 m-auto col-md-8 col-12\"><div class=\"product-features-box\"><div id=\"tablistcontainer\" class=\"tabs\"><!----><div class=\"\"><ul role=\"tablist\" id=\"tablistcontainer__BV_tab_controls_\" class=\"nav justify-content-center\"><!----><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-setsize=\"4\" aria-posinset=\"1\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link active\" id=\"__BVID__39___BV_tab_button__\" aria-controls=\"__BVID__39\">Overview</a></li><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a id=\"specsTab___BV_tab_button__\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-setsize=\"4\" aria-posinset=\"2\" aria-controls=\"specsTab\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link\">Specs</a></li><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-setsize=\"4\" aria-posinset=\"3\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link\" id=\"__BVID__53___BV_tab_button__\" aria-controls=\"__BVID__53\">Packaging</a></li><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-setsize=\"4\" aria-posinset=\"4\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link\" id=\"__BVID__58___BV_tab_button__\" aria-controls=\"__BVID__58\">Downloads / Documents</a></li><!----></ul></div><div id=\"tablistcontainer__BV_tab_container_\" class=\"tab-content mt-3 tabs-container\"><div role=\"tabpanel\" aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"tab-pane col-12 col-xl-10 m-auto overview active\" id=\"__BVID__39\" aria-labelledby=\"__BVID__39___BV_tab_button__\"><div class=\"overview-description\"><h2>Timeless sophistication. Charming functionality.</h2>\n\n<p>If charm, elegance and style is what you crave, you won’t have to look any further! With the Capri laptop handbag, the brand sets yet another trend in the world of fashion. This lightweight bag can snugly fit laptops of up to 15.6 inches, while smaller pockets provide extra room to carry accessories or other portable devices. It fuses great organization and portability features in a trendy two-tone design, couple with double stitched seams for greater durability. Made of high-quality materials and exceptional workmanship, the Capri will certainly become the most sought after accessory by the modern executive with an active lifestyle.</p>\n\n<h2>Features:</h2>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Protection:</strong> Fully lined main compartment, with interior divider and a strap, suitable for laptops of up to 15.6 inches</li>\n\t<li><strong>Organization:</strong> Ample interior featuring a slip pocket and a zippered compartment, ideal for keeping all your items protected and perfectly organized. A metal clip is attached to a strap to easily secure and find the keys inside the bag</li>\n\t<li><strong>Convenience:</strong> A large zippered pocket on the back adds extra storage for quick access to your</li>\n\t<li><strong>Comfort:</strong> Leatherette straps with fine stitching along the edge</li>\n\t<li><strong>Material:</strong> 100% premium quality polyester</li>\n</ul></div></div> <div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"specsTab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"specsTab___BV_tab_button__\" class=\"tab-pane col-12 m-auto specs\" style=\"display: none;\"><div id=\"specsContainer\" class=\"d-flex flex-wrap col-12 p-0\"><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 pb-2 mb-2\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-Specifications-grupo.png\" alt=\"Specifications\" height=\"25px\"> <h6 class=\"font-weight-bolder d-inline-block pl-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSpecifications\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6> <hr> <div><ul>\n\t<li><strong>Fits laptops of up to:&nbsp;</strong>15.6 inches</li>\n\t<li><strong>Number of main compartments</strong>: Two with zippered closure</li>\n\t<li><strong>Accessory pockets</strong>:&nbsp;One zippered pocket on back panel</li>\n\t<li><strong>Material:</strong>&nbsp;Exterior: 100% polyester and leatherette accents<br>\n\t<strong>Lining</strong>: high-quality polyester</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 pb-2 mb-2\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-Dimensions-grupo.png\" alt=\"Dimensions\" height=\"25px\"> <h6 class=\"font-weight-bolder d-inline-block pl-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDimensions\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6> <hr> <div><ul>\n\t<li><strong>Exterior (LxWxH):</strong>&nbsp;16.9x5.7x11.8in</li>\n\t<li><strong>Laptop compartment (LxWxH)</strong>:&nbsp;15.3x0.8x10.2in</li>\n\t<li><strong>Max. load capacity:&nbsp;</strong>17.6lb</li>\n\t<li><strong>Weight:&nbsp;</strong>1.2lb</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 pb-2 mb-2\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-Additional-information-grupo.png\" alt=\"Additional information\" height=\"25px\"> <h6 class=\"font-weight-bolder d-inline-block pl-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAdditional information\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6> <hr> <div><ul>\n\t<li><strong>Warranty</strong>:&nbsp;One year</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div></div></div> <div role=\"tabpanel\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tab-pane col-12 col-xl-12 m-auto\" style=\"display: none;\" id=\"__BVID__53\" aria-labelledby=\"__BVID__53___BV_tab_button__\"><div class=\"col-12 col-lg-8 m-auto\"><div role=\"region\" id=\"carousel-fade\" aria-busy=\"false\" class=\"c